    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEffective June 3, 1999\nAA\nANNIVERSARY\nescape to\nIRELANd\nOn ATA You're On Vacation™",
      "NONSTOP SCHEDULED SERVICE ROUTES\n25 years of great destinations,\nlow fares \u0026 priceless memories.\nMILWAUKEE\nMADISON •\nLANSING\nDES MOINES *\nCHICAGO\n• DAY TON\nINDIANAPOLIS\nNEW YORK\n(JFK \u0026 LGA)\nPHILADELPHIA\n(JFK 6/99)\n*FRANCISCO\nLAS VEGAS\nLOS ANGELES\nPHOENIX\nDENVER\nDALLAS\nORLANDO\n•FT. LAUDERDALE\nHONOLULU MAUI\nCALL YOUR TRAVEL AGENT,\nBOOK ONLINE AT ATA.COM\nOR CALL ATA AT\n1-800-I-FLY-ATA\nST. PETE\nSARASOTA®\nFT. MYERS\n(6/99)\nAA\na•000. • Operated by Chicago Express\nCANCUN •\nDUBLIN\nSHANNON\nSAN JUAN"
    ],
